{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6f1c0a52-3c1e-4c8e-9d2b-0b7a5f0e1a11",
    "name": "ohip-streaming — APIs Oracle usadas pelo projeto",
    "description": "Chamadas da Oracle que o ohip-streaming usa, conferidas contra as specs oficiais em vendor/oracle-hospitality-api-docs (commit 4bd129b). Análise: docs/OHIP_APIS.md.\n\n**Regras**\n- Use só ambientes de sandbox/homologação. **Nunca** a app key de produção: o Postman não mantém o heartbeat do Streaming e uma conexão dele disputa/derruba o consumer (4409).\n- Pedir token é cobrado para parceiros: reaproveite o token até ~2 min antes do `exp`.\n- Não exporte nem commite o environment preenchido (postman/README.md).\n- O Streaming (WebSocket + GraphQL) não é testado por aqui: use o cliente de referência da Oracle (vendor/.../graphql/streaming/graphiql.html) contra o sandbox.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. OAuth (Fase 4)",
      "description": "POST /oauth/v1/tokens — spec: rest-api-specs/security/v1/publishedoauth.json.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Token — client_credentials (OCIM)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Guarda o token só no environment (valor atual, nunca no valor inicial) e calcula o",
                  "// hash da app key usado na URL do Streaming. Nunca imprime o token.",
                  "pm.test('token emitido', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('Token', body.access_token);",
                  "pm.environment.set('HashedAppKey', CryptoJS.SHA256(pm.environment.get('AppKey')).toString());",
                  "console.log('token expira em (s):', body.expires_in);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{CLIENT_ID}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{CLIENT_SECRET}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-app-key",
                "value": "{{AppKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Request-Id",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "enterpriseId",
                "value": "{{EnterpriseId}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "Só em ambientes OCIM com client_credentials."
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "client_credentials",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "scope",
                  "value": "{{Scope}}",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{HostName}}/oauth/v1/tokens",
              "host": [
                "{{HostName}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "oauth",
                "v1",
                "tokens"
              ]
            },
            "description": "OHIP_AUTH_MODE=client_credentials. Basic = CLIENT_ID:CLIENT_SECRET."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Token — resource owner (usuário de integração)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Guarda o token só no environment (valor atual, nunca no valor inicial) e calcula o",
                  "// hash da app key usado na URL do Streaming. Nunca imprime o token.",
                  "pm.test('token emitido', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('Token', body.access_token);",
                  "pm.environment.set('HashedAppKey', CryptoJS.SHA256(pm.environment.get('AppKey')).toString());",
                  "console.log('token expira em (s):', body.expires_in);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{CLIENT_ID}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{CLIENT_SECRET}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-app-key",
                "value": "{{AppKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Request-Id",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "password",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{Username}}",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{Password}}",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{HostName}}/oauth/v1/tokens",
              "host": [
                "{{HostName}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "oauth",
                "v1",
                "tokens"
              ]
            },
            "description": "OHIP_AUTH_MODE=resource_owner. Basic = CLIENT_ID:CLIENT_SECRET + usuário de integração do OPERA."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Enriquecimento — recurso completo (Fase 9)",
      "description": "O enricher busca o recurso completo pelo primaryKey + hotelId do evento (RF-09). Os módulos enriquecidos dependem da Q-1; aqui estão os dois certos.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Reserva — getReservation (moduleName RESERVATION)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 429) { console.warn('429: respeitar Retry-After (RF-09)'); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{Token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-app-key",
                "value": "{{AppKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-hotelid",
                "value": "{{HotelId}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "Obrigatório em todas as Property APIs, inclusive no CRM."
              },
              {
                "key": "x-request-id",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "GUID por chamada: ajuda a Oracle a investigar problemas."
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{HostName}}/rsv/v1/hotels/{{HotelId}}/reservations/{{ReservationId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{HostName}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "rsv",
                "v1",
                "hotels",
                "{{HotelId}}",
                "reservations",
                "{{ReservationId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Spec: rest-api-specs/property/v1/rsv.json, operationId getReservation."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Perfil — getProfile (moduleName PROFILE)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 429) { console.warn('429: respeitar Retry-After (RF-09)'); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{Token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-app-key",
                "value": "{{AppKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-hotelid",
                "value": "{{HotelId}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "Obrigatório em todas as Property APIs, inclusive no CRM."
              },
              {
                "key": "x-request-id",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "type": "text",
                "description": "GUID por chamada: ajuda a Oracle a investigar problemas."
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{HostName}}/crm/v1/profiles/{{ProfileId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{HostName}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "crm",
                "v1",
                "profiles",
                "{{ProfileId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Spec: rest-api-specs/property/v1/crm.json, operationId getProfile. A resposta tem dados pessoais: não salve exemplos com dados reais."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
